        <mxCell id="tgwmode" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2EBFF;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;appliance mode: ON&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Set on the &lt;b&gt;inspection VPC&lt;/b&gt; attachment. Pins &lt;b&gt;both directions&lt;/b&gt; of a flow to the AZ it started in &amp;#8212; this is what the original design tried to do with Lambda.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
