        <mxCell id="sp_note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2EBFF;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;This whole account is one Terraform module.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Written once, then run 30 times with 30 tfvars files. The only value that changes between spokes is the /16, and IPAM hands that out so two spokes can never collide.&lt;br&gt;A new account is onboarded by Step Functions &amp;#8212; that is where automation belongs, not in the packet path.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
